{"id":"e8c001a7-4e9f-5515-a2e4-8ed6085ef46d","title":"在 Agent 中使用","icon":"🤝","cover":"none","parentId":"79fa3b16-d74e-58cd-81a0-2c01bd8a9499","favorite":false,"archived":false,"createdAt":"2026-10-15T06:42:08.471Z","updatedAt":"2026-10-21T17:41:46.667Z","content":{"type":"surface","attrs":{"id":"root","kind":"page","name":"在 Agent 中使用","widthMode":"standard"},"content":[{"type":"widget","attrs":{"kind":"custom","data":{"componentId":"doc-hero","version":"1.0.0","props":{"eyebrow":"Claude Code · Codex · 内置 Agent","title":"在你常用的 Agent 里使用 ShowAI","lead":"连接 ShowAI 后，Agent 可以用界面而不是一段文字来回答，把它保存为 ShowAI 项目中的页面，之后还能在你的修改上继续。","facts":[{"label":"正式支持","value":"Claude Code · Codex · 内置 Agent"},{"label":"安装插件","value":"App「设置 → 插件」"},{"label":"需要","value":"ShowAI App · 已登录的 Agent"}],"actions":[{"label":"快速上手","href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/quick-start","primary":true},{"label":"连接 Agent 时的常见问题","href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/agent-troubleshooting"}],"art":"agent"},"integrity":"sha256-7c2bbe84b00357b5e96de32cad51cf6537d38c28d4eadca35435483ba772646e"},"id":"node-52582d9"}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"id":"node-4258146"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"支持的 Agent"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"刚开始使用，从「正式」三项中选一个。其余 Agent 列在「更多 Agent」中，状态表示目前的支持程度。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-3257fb3"}},{"type":"widget","attrs":{"kind":"custom","data":{"componentId":"doc-compare","version":"1.0.0","props":{"columns":[{"id":"status","label":"状态","tone":"brand"},{"id":"how","label":"接入方式","tone":"teal"}],"rows":[{"group":"正式","label":"Claude Code","values":{"status":"正式","how":"ShowAI「设置 → 插件」→ 安装插件"}},{"group":"正式","label":"Codex","values":{"status":"正式","how":"ShowAI「设置 → 插件」→ 安装插件"}},{"group":"正式","label":"内置 Agent","values":{"status":"正式","how":"在 ShowAI 中使用本机 Codex 或 Claude Code 的登录、模型 API Key 或 Cloud"}},{"group":"更多 Agent","label":"DeepSeek Harness","values":{"status":"预览","how":"「设置 → 插件 → 准备插件」，再在 DeepSeek Harness 中添加"}},{"group":"更多 Agent","label":"Kimi","values":{"status":"预览","how":"仓库中的 `plugins-kimi` 插件，加手动配置的本机 MCP"}},{"group":"更多 Agent","label":"网页版 ChatGPT","values":{"status":"邀请制","how":"托管 MCP，需要注册码或项目邀请"}},{"group":"更多 Agent","label":"其他 MCP 客户端","hint":"Gemini CLI、OpenCode 等","values":{"status":"实验","how":"手动配置 stdio MCP"}}],"note":"内置 Agent 的设置见 [内置 Agent](https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/built-in-agent)；更多 Agent 的接入步骤见本页下文。"},"integrity":"sha256-3a5b6ff02c26c6d04060377c93d47041a961d40fcd062e5944842df3976755d0"},"id":"node-2257e20"}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"id":"node-9258925"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"在 Claude Code 或 Codex 中安装插件"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"插件为 Agent 提供 ShowAI 的工具和一组技能；ShowAI App 负责保存页面，并提供插件连接的运行时。"},{"type":"text","text":"先安装 App，插件随 App 提供","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"，不需要源码，也不需要单独安装 Node.js。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-8258792"}},{"type":"widget","attrs":{"kind":"custom","data":{"componentId":"doc-steps","version":"1.0.0","props":{"steps":[{"title":"安装 ShowAI App","body":"需要 Apple Silicon Mac（macOS 13 或更高版本），以及已安装并登录的 Claude Code 或 Codex。下载与首次打开见 [安装与运行](doc:install)。"},{"title":"打开插件面板","body":"首次启动时的欢迎页，或随时打开「设置 → 插件」。"},{"title":"安装插件","body":"在 Claude Code 或 Codex 旁点「安装插件」。ShowAI 通过 Agent 自己的插件命令安装，因此需要 Agent 的命令行工具可用（`claude --version` 或 `codex --version`）；macOS 还会检查常见 Codex App 安装位置中的内置 CLI。","result":"显示「已安装并启用」，安装文件与启用状态已核验。"},{"title":"重新加载 Agent，新开一个对话","body":"Claude Code 重启会话；Codex 刷新插件或重启 Codex。已经打开的对话仍使用旧的工具列表。"},{"title":"在新对话中请求一个界面","body":"粘贴下面的提示词：\n“用 ShowAI 帮我做一个房贷计算器：房价、首付比例、利率和贷款年限可以调整，显示月供和总利息。”","result":"Agent 调用 ShowAI 工具、保存页面并展示出来；在 App 中，它出现在「最近」里。"}]},"integrity":"sha256-660edad476b2fda02cf5d65a2e90470d95d7c2335d975efaa102a0360d58f20a"},"id":"node-72585ff"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"插件连接 App 当前的内容库。切换内容库或移动 App 后，点「更新并启用」。如果已经启用了其他来源的 ShowAI 插件，先在 Agent 中停用它，再点「重新检测」。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-625846c"}},{"type":"callout","attrs":{"icon":"🔍","tone":"blue","id":"node-d258f71"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Agent 只用文字回答、面板显示「已安装，尚未启用」，或页面保存了却在 App 里找不到？见 "},{"type":"text","text":"连接 Agent 时的常见问题","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/agent-troubleshooting"}}]},{"type":"text","text":"。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-2d764dfe"}}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"id":"node-c258dde"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"选择内容库和项目"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"从 App 安装的插件使用 App 的内容库。自行配置启动方式的 Agent，可以在 MCP 进程启动前设置下面的变量。"},{"type":"text","text":"运行期间不切换内容库","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"；要换库，让 Agent 停止并按新配置重连。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-fd0accc2"}},{"type":"table","content":[{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableHeader","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"变量"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-400dc782"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-e2042a0d"}},{"type":"tableHeader","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"作用"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-6497586d"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-e104287a"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-41c91f9a"}},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"SHOWAI_HOME","marks":[{"type":"code"}]}],"attrs":{"id":"node-fe332445"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-bc3d64a2"}},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"本机内容库的位置，未设置时用当前用户的 "},{"type":"text","text":"~/.showai","marks":[{"type":"code"}]}],"attrs":{"id":"node-790b2b7a"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-bd3d6635"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-42c9212d"}},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"SHOWAI_PROJECT_ID","marks":[{"type":"code"}]}],"attrs":{"id":"node-5b01cc7c"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-ebb64ae3"}},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"可选，把连接锁定到一个已有项目"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-80c891e7"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-eab64950"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-3fc91c74"}},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"SHOWAI_TEMPLATES","marks":[{"type":"code"}]}],"attrs":{"id":"node-59b2267f"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-672c22d8"}},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"可选，项目连接的启动模板，格式 "},{"type":"text","text":"ID[@VERSION],ID","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":"；必须同时设置 "},{"type":"text","text":"SHOWAI_PROJECT_ID","marks":[{"type":"code"}]}],"attrs":{"id":"node-53eb9374"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-682c246b"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-40c91e07"}},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"SHOWAI_PRESENTATION_DIR","marks":[{"type":"code"}]}],"attrs":{"id":"node-36ad1ad6"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-96555739"}},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"可选，宿主可读取的展示输出目录"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-dbd54601"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-955555a6"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-3dc9194e"}},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"SHOWAI_RUNTIME_CONFIG","marks":[{"type":"code"}]}],"attrs":{"id":"node-11cbe1f9"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-90de760e"}},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"可选，显式指定运行时配置文件，其中的内容库必须与 "},{"type":"text","text":"SHOWAI_HOME","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":" 一致"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-c5500ce"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-91de77a1"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-3ec91ae1"}},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"SHOWAI_READER_CDN","marks":[{"type":"code"}]}],"attrs":{"id":"node-6ec79fd0"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-c007aa6f"}},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"设为 "},{"type":"text","text":"off","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":" 时预览完全离线，不从网络加载阅读器"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-948e653b"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-bf07a8dc"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-3bc91628"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-fe0ace55"}},{"type":"callout","attrs":{"icon":"🔒","tone":"sand","id":"node-fb0ac99c"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"本机启动入口只查找所选内容库中登记的运行时。版本不兼容或连接失败会明确报错，不会改用其他内容库，Agent 也不会改用 CLI 或未保存的网页代替。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-70f253fb"}}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"id":"node-fc0acb2f"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"一次修改是怎样完成的"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"连接 ShowAI 的 Agent 修改页面都走同一条路线：先读完整页面，带着版本保存，再展示。逐步播放下面的过程。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-f90ac676"}},{"type":"widget","attrs":{"kind":"custom","data":{"componentId":"doc-sequence","version":"1.0.0","props":{"title":"Agent 修改一个已有页面","actors":[{"id":"user","label":"你","icon":"🙋","tone":"slate"},{"id":"agent","label":"Agent","sub":"Claude Code、Codex 等","icon":"🤖","tone":"brand"},{"id":"mcp","label":"ShowAI MCP","sub":"本机或远程","tone":"teal"},{"id":"lib","label":"项目","sub":"内容库","icon":"🗂️","tone":"warm"},{"id":"app","label":"ShowAI App","icon":"🖥️","tone":"violet"}],"steps":[{"from":"user","to":"agent","label":"“给这份报告补一张对比表”","kind":"call","detail":"你只需要说要做什么。Agent 根据技能说明决定调用哪些工具。"},{"from":"agent","to":"mcp","label":"showai_capabilities","kind":"call","detail":"首次操作先调用 `showai_capabilities`，再用 `project_context` 核对连接类型、可用项目和显示能力。之后每个项目操作都显式传 `projectId`。"},{"from":"mcp","to":"agent","label":"项目与页面列表","kind":"reply","detail":"找已有内容用 `projects_list`、`pages_list` 或 `library_search`。只读查找不会创建项目。"},{"from":"agent","to":"mcp","label":"page_read","kind":"call","detail":"读取完整页面，记下返回的 `hash` 和 `revision`，以及要修改的节点 ID。"},{"from":"agent","to":"mcp","label":"page_apply","kind":"call","detail":"带上读取时的 hash 和 revision，只修改相关节点。如果页面在此期间被改过，保存会返回冲突，Agent 需要比较两份内容后再合并，不能直接覆盖。"},{"from":"mcp","to":"lib","label":"保存新版本","kind":"call","detail":"页面保存到你选定的项目。远程连接还会同步到服务器并返回同步回执。"},{"from":"lib","to":"app","label":"App 载入更新","kind":"note","detail":"App 没有未保存修改时直接载入新内容；有修改时进入冲突处理，两份内容都会保留。"},{"from":"agent","to":"mcp","label":"page_present","kind":"call","detail":"展示已保存的页面，不会改动它。返回完整 HTML、源文件和对话内预览。"},{"from":"agent","to":"user","label":"在对话中显示结果","kind":"reply","detail":"支持 MCP Apps 的 Agent 直接显示阅读器；Codex 使用本机可视化；其他情况下 Agent 交给你 HTML 文件。"}]},"integrity":"sha256-54ea7e21b2eb7835fb0ba41ca4d48f1ab21bc27b88b7f8fa2b03d3b910b05e76"},"id":"node-fa0ac809"}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":3,"id":"node-f70ac350"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"结果怎样显示"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"page_present","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":" 返回几种交付物，Agent 按宿主能力选用。完整 HTML 和源文件始终包含整页；预览过大时，Agent 展示选定的内容块，同时保留完整页面交付。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-f80ac4e3"}},{"type":"table","content":[{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableHeader","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"交付物"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-260f5ce5"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-51215d42"}},{"type":"tableHeader","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"内容"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-a0e7641a"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-52215ed5"}},{"type":"tableHeader","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"适合"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-d010987b"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-4f215a1c"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-3dfed9cd"}},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"delivery.html","marks":[{"type":"code"}]}],"attrs":{"id":"node-d08c79a2"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-75aaee2d"}},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"离线完整页面，打开不需要联网"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-f6533f0d"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-74aaec9a"}},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"能打开或发布本地文件的宿主"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-7b7b37d8"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-73aaeb07"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-3cfed83a"}},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"delivery.inline","marks":[{"type":"code"}]}],"attrs":{"id":"node-ea30d89f"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-fad2e6f8"}},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"对话预览，优先携带压缩的本地阅读器"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-e5a77a14"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-fbd2e88b"}},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"MCP Apps、Codex 本机可视化"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-407f4ee9"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-fcd2ea1e"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-3bfed6a7"}},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"delivery.compact","marks":[{"type":"code"}]}],"attrs":{"id":"node-f845f9c"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-997a03"}},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"几 KB 的片段，打开时在线加载阅读器"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-340df087"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-ff997870"}},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"需要模型直接写出 HTML 的宿主"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-e494d7e6"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-2997d29"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-3afed514"}},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"delivery.online","marks":[{"type":"code"}]}],"attrs":{"id":"node-c5114099"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-a5c1a52e"}},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"小体积在线页面"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-40d6ca6e"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-a6c1a6c1"}},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"联网环境中分享单个文件"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-6ffffecf"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-a3c1a208"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-39fed381"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-50ad95a"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"导出是快照，源页面后续修改不会更新旧的导出文件。只想要一个不入库的独立文件时，明确告诉 Agent，它会用 "},{"type":"text","text":"render_document","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":" 生成，并说明没有保存到项目。导出格式的区别见 "},{"type":"text","text":"导出与分享","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/export"}}]},{"type":"text","text":"。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-60adaed"}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"id":"node-7707bb39"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"更多 Agent"}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":3,"id":"node-7607b9a6"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"DeepSeek Harness（预览）"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"DeepSeek Harness 由自己安装插件，ShowAI 为它准备一个完整的插件包，包含绑定当前运行时和内容库的工具、技能与对话内页面预览。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-7507b813"}},{"type":"widget","attrs":{"kind":"custom","data":{"componentId":"doc-steps","version":"1.0.0","props":{"steps":[{"title":"先打开一次 DeepSeek Harness","body":"让它创建桌面配置。ShowAI 找不到它时会提示先安装并打开一次，再「重新检测」。"},{"title":"在 ShowAI 中准备插件","body":"打开「设置 → 插件」，在 DeepSeek Harness 旁点「准备插件」。面板会列出插件包路径，以及需要先清理的旧配置。"},{"title":"在 DeepSeek Harness 中添加并启用","body":"在 DeepSeek Harness 侧栏「插件 → 添加插件」中粘贴路径，安装后点「立即启用」，然后重启 DeepSeek Harness。","result":"新对话中可以使用 ShowAI 工具，并在对话里预览页面。"}]},"integrity":"sha256-660edad476b2fda02cf5d65a2e90470d95d7c2335d975efaa102a0360d58f20a"},"id":"node-7407b680"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"更新 ShowAI、切换内容库后，在「设置 → 插件」点「更新插件文件」，再重启 DeepSeek Harness，无需重新添加。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-7b07c185"}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":3,"id":"node-7a07bff2"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Kimi（预览）"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Kimi Work 的插件位于仓库的 "},{"type":"text","text":"plugins-kimi/showai","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":"，只包含技能，不带运行时和 MCP 启动器。先安装并启动 ShowAI，在 Kimi Work 中添加本机 MCP 服务（启动命令见下文「其他 MCP 客户端」），再把 "},{"type":"text","text":"plugins-kimi/showai","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":" 目录作为本地插件加入。新建对话，确认 ShowAI 工具可见后再请求页面。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-7907be5f"}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":3,"id":"node-7807bccc"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"网页版 ChatGPT（邀请制）"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"通过托管 MCP 与 ShowAI Cloud 账号接入，注册需要运营者提供的注册密钥或共享项目的邀请。完整步骤见 "},{"type":"text","text":"网页版 ChatGPT（邀请制）","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/chatgpt"}}]},{"type":"text","text":"。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-7f07c7d1"}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":3,"id":"node-7e07c63e"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"其他 MCP 客户端（实验）"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Gemini CLI、OpenCode 等支持 stdio MCP 的客户端，手动添加一个本机 MCP 服务。在 ShowAI 的「设置 → 插件」中点「复制启动配置」，得到可执行路径、参数和 "},{"type":"text","text":"SHOWAI_HOME","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":"，在参数末尾追加 "},{"type":"text","text":"mcp","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":" 子命令。从源码运行时，也可以直接使用构建好的 CLI："}],"attrs":{"id":"node-71057330"}},{"type":"codeBlock","attrs":{"language":"sh","id":"node-720574c3"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"node /ABSOLUTE/PATH/TO/ShowAI/dist-runtime/scripts/cli.mjs mcp --home /ABSOLUTE/LIBRARY"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"加 "},{"type":"text","text":"--project PROJECT","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":" 可绑定一个项目，加 "},{"type":"text","text":"--presentation-directory /HOST_OUTPUT","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":" 指定展示目录。是否能在对话里显示 HTML 取决于客户端本身，支持 MCP 不等于支持显示。传输方式与权限见 "},{"type":"text","text":"CLI 与 MCP 参考","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/cli"}}]},{"type":"text","text":"。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-73057656"}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"id":"node-740577e9"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"从源码安装"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"开发 ShowAI、从源码运行，或使用 Windows、Linux 的浏览器版时，在源码仓库根目录安装插件。需要 "},{"type":"text","text":"Node.js 22.12+","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":" 和支持 "},{"type":"text","text":"showai-mcp-v1","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":" 的运行时。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-7505797c"}},{"type":"widget","attrs":{"kind":"custom","data":{"componentId":"doc-steps","version":"1.0.0","props":{"steps":[{"title":"登记运行时","body":"先启动一次构建好的 App 或浏览器版，或执行下面的命令，让目标内容库登记 `agent-runtime.json`。","code":"npm run runtime:register","lang":"sh"},{"title":"安装插件","body":"Codex 安装器需要 `PATH` 中有 Codex CLI，使用官方 Codex 插件命令安装，并核验版本、启用状态和文件指纹。","variants":[{"label":"Codex","code":"npm run plugin:install -- --json"},{"label":"Claude Code","code":"claude plugin marketplace add ./\nclaude plugin install showai@renaissance-mind"}]},{"title":"拉取新代码后更新 Codex 插件","code":"npm run plugin:update -- --json","lang":"sh","note":"更新后新开一个会话，旧会话不会重新加载工具。"}]},"integrity":"sha256-660edad476b2fda02cf5d65a2e90470d95d7c2335d975efaa102a0360d58f20a"},"id":"node-76057b0f"}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"id":"node-77057ca2"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"接下来"}]},{"type":"widget","attrs":{"kind":"custom","data":{"componentId":"doc-cards","version":"1.0.0","props":{"columns":3,"cards":[{"icon":"🔍","title":"连接 Agent 时的常见问题","body":"按看到的情况找到原因和处理方法。","href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/agent-troubleshooting"},{"icon":"🧠","title":"技能与工作流程","body":"各个技能分别负责什么，Agent 怎样从规划做到交付。","href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/skills"},{"icon":"🤖","title":"内置 Agent","body":"不离开 App，在页面里直接让 AI 修改内容。","href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/built-in-agent"}]},"integrity":"sha256-96ea3af150bd5892ccd24a456bfe0fa6c6c312635d9b19e4a1bcf063be65ffa1"},"id":"node-78057e35"}}]},"layout":{},"surfaceViews":{"root":{"initial":null,"saved":[],"readingOrder":["node-52582d9","node-4258146","node-3257fb3","node-2257e20","node-9258925","node-8258792","node-72585ff","node-625846c","node-d258f71","node-c258dde","node-fd0accc2","node-fe0ace55","node-fb0ac99c","node-fc0acb2f","node-f90ac676","node-fa0ac809","node-f70ac350","node-f80ac4e3","node-50ad95a","node-60adaed","node-7707bb39","node-7607b9a6","node-7507b813","node-7407b680","node-7b07c185","node-7a07bff2","node-7907be5f","node-7807bccc","node-7f07c7d1","node-7e07c63e","node-71057330","node-720574c3","node-73057656","node-740577e9","node-7505797c","node-76057b0f","node-77057ca2","node-78057e35"]}},"comments":[]}